---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/pages/services.css';
---
<BaseLayout nav="services" logic="base">
<!-- ============ PAGE HERO (centred) ============ -->
<section style="background: var(--tint2); position: relative; overflow: hidden">
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 420px; height: 420px; border-radius: 50%; background: #DFE7FF; right: -140px; top: -160px"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 140px; height: 140px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C9F4F7; left: 6%; bottom: -60px"></div>
<div style="position: relative; max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 22px">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display: flex; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted)"><a href="/" style="color: var(--muted)">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span style="color: var(--ink)">Services</span></nav>
<h1 style="font-size: clamp(38px, 4.4vw, 58px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink); text-wrap: balance">Everything your clinic needs to get <span style="color: var(--blue)">booked</span></h1>
<p style="font-size: clamp(17px, 1.4vw, 19px); max-width: 640px; text-wrap: pretty">A website that converts, Google visibility that brings patients to it, and ads that fill the gaps. Each one works on its own. Together, they bring in qualified calls and consultation requests.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 14px"><a class="btn btn-cta" href="/contact-website-development-services/">Book a Free Clinic Growth Audit</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/web-design-portfolio/">View Our Work</a></div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ HOW IT WORKS TOGETHER (GrowthFlow) ============ -->
<section style="background: #fff">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; align-items: center">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 14px; max-width: 680px"><p class="eb">How it works together</p><h2 class="h2">Three channels, one goal: more bookings</h2></div>
<div style="width: 100%; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 20px">
<a href="/seo-services-in-the-philippines/" style="border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; color: inherit; background: var(--tint2)"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--blue)">1 · GET FOUND</span><span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink)">SEO</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Patients searching for your treatments find your clinic on Google Search and Maps.</span></a>
<a href="/google-ads-services/" style="border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; color: inherit; background: var(--tint2)"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--blue)">2 · REACH MORE</span><span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink)">Paid Advertising</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Google, Facebook and Instagram ads put your clinic in front of people ready to book.</span></a>
<a href="/web-development-seo-google-ads-services/website-development/" style="border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; color: inherit; background: var(--tint2)"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--blue)">3 · CONVERT</span><span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink)">Web Development</span><span style="font-size: 15px">Your website turns that traffic into calls and consultation requests.</span></a>
</div>
<svg width="28" height="40" viewBox="0 0 28 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2v32M4 26l10 10 10-10" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
<div style="background: var(--blue); color: #fff; border-radius: 999px; padding: 18px 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4"></path><path d="m9 15 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Qualified calls &amp; consultation requests</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SERVICE ROW: WEB ============ -->
<section style="background: var(--tint)">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(460px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px); align-items: center">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start">
<p class="eb">Web Development</p>
<h2 class="h2">Clinic websites built to turn visitors into consultations</h2>
<p>Fast, secure, SEO-ready websites, starting with keyword research and custom design that fits your brand.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-size: 16px">
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Conversion-focused, mobile-first design</li>
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Treatment pages built to rank</li>
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Booking and enquiry flows built in</li>
</ul>
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/web-development-seo-google-ads-services/website-development/" style="margin-top: 6px">Explore Web Development</a>
</div>
<div style="background: #fff; border-radius: 32px; padding: 48px 40px 56px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 380px; position: relative; overflow: hidden">
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 70%; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 50%; background: #EEF2FD; right: -12%; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%)"></div>
<div style="position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 520px">
<div style="position: relative; width: 90%">
<div style="background: #1A2036; border-radius: 16px 16px 6px 6px; padding: 9px 9px 12px; box-shadow: 0 34px 60px -30px rgba(13,24,56,0.45)">
<div style="border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 9px 12px; background: #F1F3F8"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF8A80"></span><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFD166"></span><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #7BD88F"></span><span style="margin-left: 8px; flex: 1; max-width: 240px; background: #fff; border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #646B88; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis">coastalluxeaesthetics.com.au</span></div>
<img src="/images/cla-desk.webp" alt="Coastal Luxe Aesthetics website, built by Digital Services Master" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</div>
</div>
<div style="height: 12px; margin: 0 -6%; background: #CDD3E2; border-radius: 0 0 16px 16px; box-shadow: inset 0 3px 0 #E6EAF3"></div>
</div>
<div style="position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: -24px; width: 25%; background: #1A2036; border-radius: 22px; padding: 6px; box-shadow: 0 26px 44px -20px rgba(13,24,56,0.5)">
<img src="/images/cla-photo.webp" alt="" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 9 / 17; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 17px" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SERVICE ROW: SEO ============ -->
<section style="background: #fff">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap-reverse; gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px); align-items: center">
<div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0; background: var(--tint2); border-radius: 32px; padding: 36px; min-height: 380px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; justify-content: center">
<div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; padding: 14px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink)"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#646B88" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path></svg>dental implants near me</div>
<div style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden">
<div style="height: 110px; background: #E4ECE6; position: relative"><span style="position: absolute; left: 30%; top: 30%; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 0; transform: rotate(-45deg); background: #3D66E4"></span><span style="position: absolute; left: 62%; top: 48%; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 0; transform: rotate(-45deg); background: #A3ADC6"></span><span style="position: absolute; left: 48%; top: 20%; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 0; transform: rotate(-45deg); background: #A3ADC6"></span></div>
<div style="padding: 16px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--tint); box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px #3D66E4"><span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.35"><span style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); font-size: 15px">Your Dental Clinic</span><span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted)">Dentist · Open now</span></span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: var(--blue); border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px">Call</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 0 14px"><span style="width: 50%; height: 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #E3E8F4"></span><span style="width: 32%; height: 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: #EEF1F7"></span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 0 14px"><span style="width: 44%; height: 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #E3E8F4"></span><span style="width: 28%; height: 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: #EEF1F7"></span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start">
<p class="eb">SEO</p>
<h2 class="h2">Get found on Google for the treatments you offer</h2>
<p>Rank for searches like Botox, fillers, veneers and implants, and show up in the local map results where nearby patients choose a clinic.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-size: 16px">
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Local search and Google Maps visibility</li>
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Treatment keyword strategy</li>
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Regular ranking reports</li>
</ul>
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/seo-services-in-the-philippines/" style="margin-top: 6px">Explore SEO</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ SERVICE ROW: ADS ============ -->
<section style="background: var(--tint)">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(64px, 8vw, 104px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(460px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px); align-items: center">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; align-items: flex-start">
<p class="eb">Paid Advertising</p>
<h2 class="h2">Ads that drive real enquiries, not clicks</h2>
<p>Google, Facebook and Instagram campaigns that reach the right people and are tracked to the calls and forms they bring in.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); font-size: 16px">
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Google Search campaigns for high-intent treatments</li>
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Facebook and Instagram campaigns</li>
<li class="chk"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#3D66E4" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="flex: none; margin-top: 3px"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"></path></svg>Call and form tracking</li>
</ul>
<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/google-ads-services/" style="margin-top: 6px">Explore Paid Advertising</a>
</div>
<div style="background: #fff; border-radius: 32px; padding: 36px; min-height: 380px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
<div style="flex: 1 1 240px; max-width: 300px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -28px rgba(13,24,56,0.35)">
<span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink)">Sponsored</span>
<span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted)">yourclinic.com</span>
<span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #1A3FB0; line-height: 1.3">Anti-Wrinkle Consultations | Book Online Today</span>
<span style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5">Experienced injectors. Easy online booking. Call or book your consultation now.</span>
</div>
<div style="flex: 0 0 200px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -28px rgba(13,24,56,0.35)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 12px"><span style="width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #F2DFD7"></span><span style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1.2"><span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink)">yourclinic</span><span style="font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted)">Sponsored</span></span></div>
<img src="/images/post-aesthetic-clinic-website-design-what-act-fm.webp" alt="" style="display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover; object-position: 70% center" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 10px 12px; background: var(--tint2)"><span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink)">Book now</span><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#131A33" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ PROCESS (ProcessSteps) ============ -->
<section style="background: #fff">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 112px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 16px"><p class="eb">How we work</p><h2 class="h2">A simple path from audit to more bookings</h2></div>
<ol style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(250px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 24px">
<li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 32px; border-radius: 28px; background: var(--tint2); border: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 17px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">01</span><h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 6px">Audit</h3><p style="font-size: 16px">We review your website, Google presence and ads, and show you where bookings are slipping away.</p></li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 32px; border-radius: 28px; background: var(--tint2); border: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 17px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">02</span><h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 6px">Strategy</h3><p style="font-size: 16px">A clear plan built around the treatments you want to sell more of and the patients you want to reach.</p></li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 32px; border-radius: 28px; background: var(--tint2); border: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--blue); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 17px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">03</span><h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 6px">Build &amp; Launch</h3><p style="font-size: 16px">We design and build your site, set up SEO foundations and launch campaigns with tracking in place.</p></li>
<li style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; padding: 32px; border-radius: 28px; background: var(--tint2); border: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); color: var(--ink); font-weight: 800; font-size: 17px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">04</span><h3 style="font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); margin-top: 6px">Grow</h3><p style="font-size: 16px">Regular reporting on calls and enquiries, with ongoing improvements to keep your bookings growing.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>

<!-- ============ CTA BAND (CtaBand) ============ -->
<section style="background: #fff; padding: 0 clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px) clamp(72px, 9vw, 112px)">
<div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--navy); border-radius: 36px; padding: clamp(48px, 7vw, 88px) clamp(24px, 6vw, 80px); position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px">
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 420px; height: 420px; border-radius: 50%; background: #1E42B1; right: -120px; top: -180px; opacity: 0.7"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; background: #00C5D3; right: 22%; bottom: -60px; opacity: 0.35"></div>
<div style="position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 620px"><h2 style="font-size: clamp(32px, 3.6vw, 50px); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 800; color: #fff">Not sure where to start?</h2><p style="color: #C9D3F2; font-size: 18px">Your free Clinic Growth Audit shows which channel will bring you the most bookings first.</p></div>
<div style="position: relative; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px"><a class="btn btn-cta" href="/contact-website-development-services/">Book a Free Clinic Growth Audit</a><a class="btn btn-light" href="/pricing-plans/">See Pricing</a></div>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
